          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "IS NANOGREENS GLUTEN FREE?",
            "answer": "<p>Nanogreens is our only product that contains traces of gluten from Organic Barley Grass. We<br/>are FDA gluten-free compliant, but we are not certified gluten-free since depending on the batch, Nanogreens contains trace amounts of gluten ranging from 7-12 ppm (parts per million). </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fTH78x": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "DO NANOGREENS NEED TO BE REFRIGERATED?",
            "answer": "<p>We recommend products be stored in the fridge after opening, but it is not required. The<br/>fridge is simply a reminder to take the product every day. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Bxtnhn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "IS NANOGREENS ORGANIC?",
            "answer": "<p>All our products are made with organic ingredients, and we source everything that can be sourced organically. There are certain key ingredients that cannot be sourced organically at this time, so we source ingredients that are non-GMO, all natural and contain NO artificial ingredients or pesticides.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_c3b9wk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "WHAT MAKES NANOGREENS SWEET?",
            "answer": "<p>Sweetened with Stevia. You may make less sweet by simply adding more water or add lemon or lime juice according to your taste preferences. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6mWWTj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW MANY SERVINGS IN A CANISTER OF NANOGREENS?",
            "answer": "<p>There are 30 (twelve-gram) servings of nanogreens in each container. nanogreens is sold by weight, not by volume. Settling will occur because of the superfine processing that allows nanogreens to mix so instantly without lots of clumping. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_PpQJxY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "HOW DO YOU GET PHYTONUTRIENTS & ANTIOXIDANTS INTO 1 SCOOP?",
            "answer": "<p>We spare no expense in purchasing the finest organic greens, fruits, and veggies that are grown and processed specifically for their high phytonutrient content. They are then juiced and low-temperature freeze-dried to concentrate all the natural goodness of freshly juiced produce, but without the sugar, fiber and water.</p>"
          }
        }
